Paragraph 2 delves into diversity-based query result approaches, which are closely related to IDT but do not fully address its unique requirements. This paragraph provides a detailed comparison between content-based and coverage-based diversity definitions in query result diversification, as well as discussing the limitations of existing algorithms for enhancing output diversity while maintaining relevance.

